{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"prompt\": \"Minecraft builder reference sheet, landscape 3:2, crisp vanilla Minecraft voxel style, plain light background, no characters or animals. Two views side by side: LEFT straight-on front elevation, orthographic; RIGHT elevated three-quarter view of the same complete narrow lot at the same building scale, showing front, side and uphill rear garden. Skilled human builder quality: real massing and depth, projecting bay and trim, recessed framed openings, real roof edges with slab eaves, verges and parapet, sub-block stairs, slabs, fences, walls, trapdoors and lanterns. No smooth non-Minecraft architecture.\\n\\nSite: A narrow San Francisco Italianate Victorian in four painted-lady colours, wedged between blank brick party walls on a steep street. Facing north onto a grey sidewalk, a rusticated grey-stone garage plinth carries a plum panelled garage door. A three-storey angled bay window rises from it: four-wide front face, stepped diagonal sides, tall narrow double-hung windows in plum sashes. Each window has a cream sill and a triangular plum-and-cream pediment hood. Gold fish-scale shingle spandrels mark each floor line, and cream corner boards run up every angle. To the right, a stone stoop with black iron handrails climbs four steps to a recessed entry porch framed by two cream columns. The porch has a small gold pediment over the entry and a panelled door with a transom deep inside. Above, a window pair sits over the porch on each upper floor. The whole front is sage-teal horizontal siding, topped by a deep cream cornice on paired plum brackets with a gold fish-scale frieze between them. The cornice wraps around the bay, and above it a flat false-front parapet carries a raised centre pediment and ball finials made of vanilla block approximations, hiding the flat roof; a brick chimney rises from the west party wall. A tiny front garden of flowers and shrubs sits behind a b